('1079245566893425760', 'Cheesecake & Creamy Desserts 🧀', '"Indulge in the creamiest cheesecake and dessert recipes! From classic New York cheesecake to no-bake treats, mousse, and rich layered desserts, discover irresistible sweet ideas perfect for any occasion. Ideal for dessert lovers, bakers, and anyone craving smooth, decadent, and share-worthy treats. Easy-to-follow recipes to satisfy every sweet tooth and impress friends and family!"', '/roseisabelle555/cheesecake-creamy-desserts/', 'https://i.pinimg.com/200x150/3a/95/75/3a9575e18ca2f682f880f0689c630bf4.jpg', 785, 0, 220, '', 'public', '{}', ''),
('1083186216567700579', 'Dinner Ideas | easy & Simple', 'Quick and easy dinner ideas perfect for busy days \nSimple homemade meals, one-pan dinners, and family-friendly recipes anyone can make.\nPerfect for weeknight dinners and everyday cooking.', '/FamilyDishRecipes/dinner-ideas-easy-simple/', 'https://i.pinimg.com/200x150/06/1d/34/061d340b3eca6fc3eb7772613ee2ed6d.jpg', 276, 0, 443, '', 'public', '{}', ''),
