('925841635911006503', 'Fluffy Baked Egg & Sausage Breakfast Pan | Easy Turkish Breakfast Recipe 🍳', 'A soft, delicious Turkish-style breakfast pan made with eggs, milk, and flour — loaded with colorful bell peppers, sausage (sucuk), and melted cheese. Perfect for busy mornings or a family brunch! 🧡 Quick to prepare, easy to bake, and full of flavor!\n\nBake Time: 15 minutes at 190°C (375°F) on the lowest rack of the oven for an evenly baked, golden top and perfectly cooked bottom.\nPro Tip: Always use baking paper to prevent sticking and achieve the best texture.\n\n\n\nIngredients :\n\n2 cups milk\n\n2 eggs\n\n1 tsp salt\n\n1 cup + 1 tbsp flour\n\nToppings: sliced green and red bell peppers, grated cheese (kaşar), sliced sausage (sucuk)', '', '', '', 21603, 19001, 58, 0, 'Wed, 29 Oct 2025 12:14:56 +0000', '', '', '', ''),
('943715296947541199', 'Healthy Chewy Granola Bar Recipe With Oats', 'Discover the best homemade Healthy Chewy Granola Bars with Oats. This easy, quick, and family-friendly recipe features wholesome rolled oats, crunchy nuts, nutrient-dense seeds, and chewy dried fruit. Perfect for a grab-and-go breakfast, healthy snack, or efficient meal prep. Craft these delicious, make-ahead energy bars for a satisfying, on-the-go boost. Ideal for kids\' lunches or an anytime healthy treat. Explore this natural, healthy snack bar recipe today.', '', '', '', 16575, 4502, 32, 0, 'Sat, 13 Sep 2025 04:13:14 +0000', '', '', '', ''),
